://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c034de3-de99-46ee-b138-e0b8f47cb923\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c034de3-de99-46ee-b138-e0b8f47cb923\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (The Blushing Mermaid)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Servitude\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Servitude</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid#Involvement\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid Basement</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My darling, your letter just about broke this old woman's heart. 'Buck-tooth Berta' they call you? Those <i>monsters</i>. \n</p><p><br>\nMeet me tonight at the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>, and together we'll sort this all out. \n</p><p><br>\nYou deserve to feel beautiful, petal - and only I can make it happen. \n</p><p><br>\nLots of love, Auntie.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211040\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1857/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33019/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8307/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930729/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.823      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.823      1 -total\n 55.59%   24.362      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.17%   21.546     19 Template:Trim\n 21.33%    9.348      2 Template:Uid\n 15.26%    6.687      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.08%    6.607      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.36%    5.418      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.23%    4.481      2 Template:CharLink\n 10.05%    4.405      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46977-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211040 and revision id 372452. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}